	(text "12MHz crystal. 12pF load capacitance.\n\nAssuming 5pF pin capacitance, 5pF pcb board\nmaybe two 4pF capacitors.\nI am still going to consiter this later and\nlearn more about setting up crystals\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.888 21.336 0)
